{
	"name": "Lay on Hands",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/holy/prayer-hands-glowing-yellow.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Your blessed touch can heal wounds. You have a pool of healing power equal to your herald level × 5. During a short rest you can roll hit dice to add the value to your Lay on Hands pool. Your pool refills completely at the end of a long rest.</p><p>As an action, you can touch a creature and draw power from the pool to restore a number of hit points to that creature up to the maximum amount remaining in your pool.</p><p>Alternatively, you can expend 5 hit points from your pool of healing to cure the target of one disease or neutralize one poison affecting it. You can cure multiple diseases and neutralize multiple poisons with a single use of Lay on Hands, expending hit points separately for each one.</p><p>This feature has no effect on undead or constructs.</p>",
